Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man's ship is right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just about 20 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as far as you know, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's the only passenger on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of the crew members are\Nfrom the Speed Wagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Chili Pepper\Nwill try to pass over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the water and sneak\Nonto the old man's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite the fact that he's\Nconfined to areas with electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he gets to Joseph first, he'll\Nkill him without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and everything we've gone through\Nwill have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We checked the boat over\Nand it's good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also checked the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of him in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready to set out\Nwhenever you give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Okuyasu and I are heading\Nover to meet with the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay here and\Nhold down the fort with Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.89,0:00:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll need backup, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, Chili Peppers' user,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is hiding somewhere in this\Nharbor watching our every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand he's laying\Nlow right now and waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.82,0:01:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us to do something\Nthat'll give away the ship's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,position and my gut's telling\Nme a boat won't be his
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hiding place all he needs to\Nmake it over to the old man
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a battery and something\Nfaster than a speed boat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once he puts those two things\Ntogether he'll use it to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,send chili pepper flying\Nto the old man's ship wait
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a second are you thinking\Nhe's gonna take to the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly frank, he's\Nprobably making off with a remote
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,controlled plane as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thought hadn't even occurred to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they pick up speed, model airplanes\Ncan fly over 100 kilometers per hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster than the motorboat's top speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because Chili Pepper will be in control\Nof it, he can fly the plane as far and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as high as the battery will take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need a remote control signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If If you spot anything flying around\Nhere, I want you to search for the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:02:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi's reverb has a range of 50\Nmeters, so he can help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that stand gets to the ship before\Nwe do, the old man is as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job is to stay on watch and\Nprotect your father from the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We clear Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we don't\Nhave a single second to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's life is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
