Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.86,0:03:38.78,Title Part 4,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,642)\pos(142,885)\fs60}Episode 12: {\fs80} Red Hot Chili Pepper Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.53,0:03:39.69,Main,Koichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Good luck, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sing to you, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In about 20 minutes, we'll finally\Narrive at the Port of Mariah, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to have misplaced my cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that it right in front of you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's my father, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never met this guy in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet I'm supposed to accept\Nthat he's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only thing that\Nmatters right now is his life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is in danger if I didn't\Neven lift a finger to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd always regret it. Besides, my mom\Nwould fall apart if the guy croaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that Jotaro if he left you two mouth\Nbreathers behind to sniff out my user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he completely saw through\Nmy remote controlled playing trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are Chili Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give this to Jotaro Kujo,\Nthe man's sharp as a tack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the last person I'd want finding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd just kill my five.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this remote-controlled\NSpitfire plane can reach
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar's boat\Nin a mere five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dinged-up old motorboat, on the other\Nhand, would take about eight to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I can put you two down for\Na dirt nap in three minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll give me time to\Ncatch up and pass them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you trying to tell\Nme you're Silly Peppers, user?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:06:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking at Akira Otoishi, age 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't let the\Nguitar throw you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day I want to be a rocking guitarist,\Nthe likes of Jimi Hendrix and Jeff Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I keep this sweet little\Nmama on my person 24 hours a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seven days a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day the masses will look\Nup from their mundane lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll be lining up for miles to\Nlet my music knock them off their feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People around the world will know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought a stand user\Nwould come out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means there's no doubt\Nin his mind that he can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slaughter both me and\NJosuke without much trouble.
