Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for round two with Shining\NDiamond, but I'll only use my little pinky,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.63,0:06:46.67,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=0}{\fade(255,0,255,-2380,-2380,-450,250)\frz8.937\pos(1316.67,589.33)}Yes!
