Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like I did with Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should get back, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's game on, Higashikata Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're planning to use only\Nyour pinky in this showdown,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I've got a couple of rules of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take your rules\Nand shove them, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rules are wasted on a pup kid like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.72,0:07:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you did say that\Nrules are wasted on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You also said something about bringing\Nme down with your pinky finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's the wannabe\Nrocker Otoishi gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any new material, fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain in my finger is unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to redirect it onto something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gnawing rage, I\Nhave defense to someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.56,Episode 12 Typesetting,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,835)\fad(232,0)}Right-Hand Tapping
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I'll kill you, then the old gas bag!
