Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was pure ecstasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart is free again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no greater euphoria than\Nletting your blistering rage fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's test that theory, Otoishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Stands can move at incredible\Nspeeds, but this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he found a way\Nto teleport behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Josuke, that's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to see everything back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otoishi didn't take a single step.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who changed position.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something moved you. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili peppers suddenly appeared and\Nflipped shining diamond around 180 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without you even realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look, you're facing the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili Pepper did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he now, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see that sparky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hiding underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using the storm\Ndrains to come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He popped halfway out of the\Ndrain to turn you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be underground electrical\Nlines running all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little soul searching always gives\Nme the boost I need to bring the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you, on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He bolts back into the electrical\Nwires at the last second,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his speed makes him hard to pin down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's the only one\Nwho can keep up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here in the harbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't have the luxury of digging\Nup asphalt and severing all the wires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higashikata Josuke. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bigger the opening you make\Nin the ground with shiny diamonds,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the easier it is to surface from below?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and knock your lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke is on your right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is like a game of\Nwhack-a-mole on steroids!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't follow his movements at\Nall when he's going that fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't keep your eye on the birdie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two minutes to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gives me plenty\Nof time to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, keep track of Chili\NPepper's location and call it out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this range, he's moving too\Nfast for my eyes to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you can't follow\Nhim, how am I supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I find him, he disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you have to look harder, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to win this and by now\Nyou should know what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That muck on the ground, the\Nasphalt's turned into tar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the drains are covered\Nin all the oil from the tar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Josuke struck the ground, he reduced\Nthe asphalt to its most basic ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you on the left!
