Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:11:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead ahead, Jotaro! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't drop your cards yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.40,0:12:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke! Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you, Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too focused on my presentation and\Nshould have just gone in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've learned my lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The juvenile me is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm reborn as a killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for my first act of anarchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll focus all of Morio's\Nelectricity into Jelly Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using this technique means temporarily\Nknocking out power all over town,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which I'm forced to draw\Non for my lifeblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But none of that matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I've done away with you cretins,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bolt over to the RC plane's battery,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll fly over to\NJoseph and slide his throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:12:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili Pepper got the best of Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it sinking in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This entire town's electrical\Npower is at my disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to really drive the point home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to charge my electric bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the month to your address.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It slides out, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a tire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were too dense to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You blew up that tire on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all part of your plan\Nto entomb my stand in rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber is an insulator, so it\Ndoesn't conduct electricity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili Pepper is powerless in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to wait for Jojaro now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good idea, but that's\Nnot gonna work on me! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your plan might have succeeded\Nhad the rubber been a meter thick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this flimsy excuse for a trap\Ndoesn't even register as a threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me show you some\Nreal power, dumbass!
