Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.84,0:14:28.88,SFXGreen,4,0,0,0,,{=19}{\clip(m 830 907 l 773 575 1207 512 1485 842 1182 1023)\bord9.74\fscx126.6\fscy97.39\fade(255,0,255,-1120,-1120,-360,40)\frz0.1779\pos(985.01,667.52)}Boom
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've lost this battle, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are as stupid as you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having your stand break through the tire\Nwas the dumbest thing you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot about the air in the tire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pressure release\Nlaunched him like a rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:14:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salt water conducts electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the ocean, the electricity that\Npowers him will scatter in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I tried to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just get me outta here!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.89,Main,Otoishi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Get me outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something about getting\Nrid of your juvenile self a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that's impossible\Nfor a lowlife like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dissolving it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stance been completely diffused,\Nwhich means that Akira is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy, but we managed\Nto defeat Chili Pepper's user!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can breathe easier now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this old geezer is Josuke's dad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind of buff, but at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like he's got\None foot in the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Okuyasu, sir. Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I live in Josuke's neighborhood,\Nand I'm also a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a stand user! Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'm a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a second-hand computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You young folks should really learn\Nto speak up and quit mumbling.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.01,0:16:41.93,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: A reference to the 1962 manga "Osomatsu-kun."
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.01,0:16:41.93,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: A reference to the 1962 Japanese comic "Osomatsu-kun."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Osumatsu, I\Ncan't seem to find my cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to know\Nwhere I left it, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding the damn thing\Nright here in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he lost his marbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I've come to\Npick up your luggage, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:17:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wouldn't be too much trouble,\Nwould you mind answering a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has Josuke ever mentioned me to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who went 16 years without knowing\Nhe had a son out there who needed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he said anything about me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but no, he\Nhasn't said much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's to be expected, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Josuke, do you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cool, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, I kind of wish\Nhe'd just go home and leave us in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't get me wrong, I'm\Nglad Otoishi didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can go back to our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, some of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never laid eyes on the guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Nthink of him as my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's barely a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be awkward for us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I hate him or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to think about\Nmy mom's well-being, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get where I'm coming from, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, we've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akira Otoishi's body disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been boarded by the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akira Otoishi is somehow still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take Mr. Jot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to tell you that he's\Nnot from the Speedwagon Foundation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the guy I have to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm on your side here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who told you about the\Nenemy in the first place, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would the real enemy\Ndo something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one you want to beat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you haven't forgotten I'm\Nthe one who pointed out the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This poser came here to\Nthrow you off your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're making sense too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the question is, who's the user?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the user! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to make\Nanother important decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I get for relying on my\Nthrill for everything all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bumping off Okuyasu will be easy enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thankfully Jotaro\Nhasn't seen my face yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to kill Joseph\Nand get the hell out of Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These half-woods will never catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's chili pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you got me a smelly sweater!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks!
