Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand user
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HAS TO BE YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH! AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody fools me twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever forget that you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured out how it was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.62,0:20:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TELL ME ALREADY!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna beat the shit out of\Nboth of you and sort it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That deduction stuff\Nis for the birds! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One misstep and you'll be\Ngoing for an unwanted swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I had my cane,\NI could manage by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it broke a few moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the strangest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I don't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you can hold on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke should have his\Nshining diamond fix the cane!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even hear yourself, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's like\Nyou don't have a brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.86,0:21:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just this once, it's\Nbetter to leave it broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if we can retrieve the bow\Nand arrow, it'll all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this town will be safe again.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.93,0:22:52.30,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind a magenta feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a shelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight like a Chaka cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to explain.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How to hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:03.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the humic and the ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I need to, I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.53,0:23:12.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what hit you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.87,0:23:14.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.49,0:23:17.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.12,0:23:21.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ooh, I've got to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.62,0:23:25.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.17,0:23:30.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ooh, I've got to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.63,0:23:34.01,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
